The examples in this directory are described in the userguide.

Short description
-----------------

concentric_cylinder1:

 Stokes problem on a rectangular (2D) domain with 3D velocities (axisymmetric).
 Cylindrical coordinates with circumferential velocity included (swirl).
 Periodical conditions and imposed flow rate in z-direction.

concentric_cylinder2:

 Viscoelastic problem on a rectangular (2D) domain with 3D velocities
 (axisymmetric).
 Cylindrical coordinates with circumferential velocity included (swirl).
 Periodical conditions and imposed flow rate in z-direction.
 DEVSS-G/SUPG
 first-order time integration to steady state

concentric_cylinder3:

 Viscoelastic problem on a rectangular (2D) domain with 3D velocities
 (axisymmetric).
 Cylindrical coordinates with circumferential velocity included (swirl).
 Periodical conditions and imposed flow rate in z-direction.
 DEVSS-G/SUPG
 second-order time integration to steady state

concentric_cylinder4:

 Viscoelastic problem on a rectangular (2D) domain with 3D velocities
 (axisymmetric).
 Cylindrical coordinates with circumferential velocity included (swirl).
 Periodical conditions and imposed flow rate in z-direction.
 DEVSS-G/SUPG
 Implicit bilinear terms of CE in momentum balance.
 L2-projection of c=exp(s) on the finite element approximation space in the
 momentum balance.
 second-order time integration to steady state

